        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac43$ or $x=\\frac43$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3x-4)(3x+4)&=0\\\\3x-4&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\\\3x+4&=0\\\\x&=\\frac43\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-\\frac43\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-review-q3-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$4x-x^2=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=0$ or $x=4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x(4-x)&=0\\\\x&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad4-x=0\\\\x&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-review-q3-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$3x^2-12x-36=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=6$ or $x=-2$",
          "worked": "Divide both sides by $3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-4x-12&=0\\\\(x-6)(x+2)&=0\\\\x-6&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x+2=0\\\\x&=6\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-review-q3-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$x^2-8x+16=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x-4)^2&=0\\\\x-4&=0\\\\x&=4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-review-q3-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$9f^2-36f+11=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$f=\\frac13$ or $f=\\frac{11}{3}$\n\nSplit the middle term and factorise by grouping.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}9f^2-3f-33f+11&=0\\\\3f(3f-1)-11(3f-1)&=0\\\\(3f-1)(3f-11)&=0\\\\3f-1&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\\\3f-11&=0\\\\f&=\\frac13\\quad\\text{or}\\quad f=\\frac{11}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-review-q3-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$12y^2+21=-32y$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=-\\frac32$ or $y=-\\frac76$\n\nRearrange to zero, then split the middle term and factorise by grouping.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}12y^2+32y+21&=0\\\\12y^2+18y+14y+21&=0\\\\6y(2y+3)+7(2y+3)&=0\\\\(2y+3)(6y+7)&=0\\\\2y+3&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\\\6y+7&=0\\\\y&=-\\frac32\\quad\\text{or}\\quad y=-\\frac76\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 66
      },
